WEBVTT

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:32.474
There are still markets
for many, many things.

00:13:32.516 --> 00:13:34.893
The state isn't involved
in making chocolate bars

00:13:34.893 --> 00:13:36.979
or socks or silk ties.

00:13:36.979 --> 00:13:38.772
But it is the central player

00:13:38.772 --> 00:13:41.024
in these four things
we all need for liberty:

00:13:42.109 --> 00:13:45.487
housing, education,
health care and transport.

00:13:46.029 --> 00:13:50.742
And to say it's no utopia
means bad things still happen, yes.

00:13:50.784 --> 00:13:53.954
There are fallings out,
there's personal enmity,

00:13:53.996 --> 00:13:56.456
there are love affairs,
you fall in and out of love.

00:13:56.456 --> 00:13:59.334
Often, falling in love is worse,
it's more dangerous.

00:13:59.334 --> 00:14:00.669
These things still happen,